WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
That group of robbers collecting protection fees at the gate of the community

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,520
It seems I can’t keep it.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,120
But there are more than a hundred of them

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:07,280
And they forcibly occupied the exit, so

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:09,520
We need to unite other residents in the community

6
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:10,880
More than 90,000 survivors

7
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,800
I'm afraid I won't be able to deal with hundreds of ruffians.

8
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,040
It's not that easy to unite strangers

9
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,320
Everyone doesn't trust each other

10
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,560
Who dares to step forward easily and risk his life as cannon fodder?

11
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:24,720
What if you use this?

12
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:27,840
I have enough long-range weapons in my hand to tempt everyone

13
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,160
Just give it a low price or borrow it

14
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,350
It can definitely build a team

15
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,480
Although Liannu is good

16
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,920
But I want to deal with hundreds of robbers

17
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,360
Only three or two are not enough

18
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,560
At least ten or more

19
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,240
Who told you there are only ten?

20
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,280
How many do you have?

21
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:46,540
There are only more than 97,000 left, right?
